       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.        TOEMMANF.
       AUTHOR.            CA YODER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.      OCTOBER 2000.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.      THE GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *D   T O E M M A N F                                             *
      *D                                                               *
      *D     THIS PROGRAM COPIES OEM MANUFACTURER RECORDS FROM         *
      *D     MCFPCS3600 TO MCFPCSOEM.                                  *
      *D                                                               *
      ******************************************************************
      *  C H A N G E S :                                               *
      *                                                                *
      *C                                                               *
      ******************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.     IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.     IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT OEM-O
               ASSIGN        TO DATABASE-MCFPCSOEM
               ORGANIZATION  IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE   IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS   IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT OEMMANF-I
               ASSIGN        TO DATABASE-OEMMANF
               ORGANIZATION  IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE   IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS   IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DMANPART-I
               ASSIGN        TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3603
               ORGANIZATION  IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE   IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY    IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                                WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS   IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  OEM-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  OEM-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPCSOEM.

       FD  OEMMANF-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  OEMMANF-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF OEMMANF.

       FD  DMANPART-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DMANPART-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS3603.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *             D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                    *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       COPY DMANPART IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                    H O L D   A R E A S                         *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X    VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X    VALUE "0".

       01  DMANPART-EOF-SW               PIC X    VALUE "N".
       01  OEMMANF-EOF-SW                PIC X    VALUE "N".
       01  ALL-MNF-IN-LIST               PIC X    VALUE "Y".
       01  SUB                           PIC 99   VALUE 0.
       01  SUBD                          PIC 9    VALUE 0.
       01  HOLD-CODE                     PIC X(8).

       01  OEMMANF-TABLE.
           05  OEMMANF-VALUE   OCCURS 50 TIMES   INDEXED BY SUBT
                                  PIC X(26).

       01  OEM-HOLD-REC.
           05  OEM-CODE                  PIC X(8).
           05  OEM-KWM                   PIC X(50).
           05  OEM-MPN-TABLE   OCCURS 8 TIMES.
               10  OEM-MANUF             PIC X(26).
               10  OEM-PART              PIC X(20).

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *               U T I L I T Y   A R E A                          *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA   IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DATAB      IN COPYLIB.

       COPY CDESC      IN COPYLIB.

      *--------- P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N ------------------*

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAINLINE SECTION.
       0-MAINLINE-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN INPUT  OEMMANF-I
                       DMANPART-I
                OUTPUT OEM-O.
      *---------- LOAD MANUFACTURER TABLE.
           INITIALIZE OEMMANF-TABLE.
           READ OEMMANF-I AT END MOVE "Y" TO OEMMANF-EOF-SW.
           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 50
                                              OR OEMMANF-EOF-SW = "Y"
               MOVE OEMMANF-REC-I TO OEMMANF-VALUE (SUB)
               READ OEMMANF-I
                   AT END MOVE "Y" TO OEMMANF-EOF-SW
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE       OEMMANF-I
                       DMANPART-I
                       OEM-O.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                M A I N   P A R A G R A P H                     *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 999-START-DMANPART.
           PERFORM 999-READ-DMANPART.
           PERFORM 60-READ-CODES UNTIL DMANPART-EOF-SW = "Y".

       60-READ-CODES.
           MOVE MAN-CORPCODE           TO  HOLD-CODE.
           INITIALIZE                      OEM-HOLD-REC.
           MOVE 1                      TO  SUBD.
           MOVE "Y"                    TO  ALL-MNF-IN-LIST.
           PERFORM 61-COPY-RECS UNTIL MAN-CORPCODE NOT = HOLD-CODE
                                   OR DMANPART-EOF-SW = "Y".
           IF ALL-MNF-IN-LIST = "Y"
               MOVE HOLD-CODE          TO  OEM-CODE
               PERFORM 62-GET-KWM
               WRITE OEM-REC-O FROM OEM-HOLD-REC.

       61-COPY-RECS.
           SET SUBT TO 1.
           SEARCH OEMMANF-VALUE VARYING SUBT
               AT END MOVE "N"         TO  ALL-MNF-IN-LIST
               WHEN OEMMANF-VALUE (SUBT) = MAN-NAME
                   NEXT SENTENCE.
           MOVE MAN-NAME               TO  OEM-MANUF (SUBD).
           MOVE MAN-PARTNO             TO  OEM-PART  (SUBD).
           ADD 1                       TO  SUBD.
           PERFORM 999-READ-DMANPART.

       62-GET-KWM.
           MOVE 2                     TO  CDESC-LINES-TO-GET.
           MOVE "D"                   TO  CDESC-DESC-OPTION.
           MOVE "N"                   TO  CDESC-LOCAL-DESC-OPTION.
           CALL "CDESC" USING CDESC-RET-CODE, BASE, STATUS-AREA,
             BU-DISPLAY-MSG, HOLD-CODE, CDESC-DATA.
           IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1 NOT = SPACES
               MOVE "*NOT ON FILE*"   TO  OEM-KWM
           ELSE
               MOVE CDESC (1)         TO  OEM-KWM.

       999-START-DMANPART.
           MOVE SPACES TO CORPCDE OF DMANPART-REC-I.
           START DMANPART-I KEY > CORPCDE OF DMANPART-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       999-READ-DMANPART.
           READ DMANPART-I NEXT INTO BUF-DMANPART
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO DMANPART-EOF-SW.

